  itemDescription: "Up to<color=#CB98ED> 4 Players</color> compete in<color=#CB98ED>
    free-for-all</color> or<color=#CB98ED> Team-based</color> battles. \nEarn Points
    by being the\n<color=#CB98ED>last one standing</color>. \nThe Player with the
    most Points wins.\n\nChange<color=#FFF8A1> Match Settings</color> in the Lobby
    to create custom Rounds.\n\nUnlock <color=#FFF8A1>new Wizzos</color> by playing
    and completing <color=#FFF8A1>Achievements</color>."
